  "description": "A widow enters a forbidden marriage with her late husband’s devoted disciple. On their wedding night, grief and desire collide, and she finds herself drawn into a passion she knows she should resist. Haunted by a promise he once made as a boy, and torn between guilt and longing, she must face whether crossing this taboo is true love or an inescapable fate waiting to consume them both.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/297086062), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13927218), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/devotion), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000077206), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=260192), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/68935314), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H049343068), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H049343068), Toon365, ZzangComic, [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=ruzw), [Qtoon](https://www.qtoon.co.kr/toon/list.mg?tcode=f0p8), [Aladin](https://www.aladin.co.kr/shop/wproduct.aspx?ItemId=389979342), [KyoboBook](https://ebook-product.kyobobook.co.kr/dig/epd/ebook/E000012740660), [Yes24](https://www.yes24.com/product/goods/185450446)",
